<title>VENEZUELA: Caracas shrs fight off profit taking to set record.</title>
<headline>Caracas shrs fight off profit taking to set record.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Share prices on the Caracas Stock Exchange fought off an early bout of profit taking to soar to an eleventh consecutive record level in continued strong trade, brokers said.</p>
<p>According to preliminary figures from the exchange, the market's 19-share  .IBC index rose 4.25 percent to 6,391.01.</p>
</text>
